WEBVTT

00:01:28.668 --> 00:01:30.086
I will never know.

00:01:30.086 --> 00:01:35.174
That said, I am learning a lot
about what it means to be a female.

00:01:35.216 --> 00:01:39.637
And I’m learning a lot
about my former gender.

00:01:40.263 --> 00:01:42.265
(Laughter)

00:01:42.306 --> 00:01:46.686
I have the unique experience
of having lived life from both sides,

00:01:46.727 --> 00:01:48.896
and I'm here to tell you,

00:01:48.938 --> 00:01:51.816
the differences are massive.

00:01:51.858 --> 00:01:54.110
(Laughter)

00:01:54.152 --> 00:01:59.115
(Applause)

00:01:59.157 --> 00:02:01.617
So I'll start with the small stuff,